een set up:\n\n## ✓ Complete Git Server Setup\n\n### **Core Infrastructure**\n- **Git Repository**: Bare repository at `/git/project` accessible via SSH\n- **SSH Server**: Password authentication enabled (user: `git`, password: `password`)\n- **Web Server**: Nginx serving HTTPS on port 8443\n- **SSL/TLS**: Self-signed certificate (365-day validity)\n\n### **Deployment System**\n- **Post-receive Hook**: Automatically triggers on git push\n- **Branch Handling**: Separate deployments for `main` and `dev` branches\n- **Deployment Directories**:\n  - Main branch → `/var/www/main/` → `https://localhost:8443/index.html`\n  - Dev branch → `/var/www/dev/` → `https://localhost:8443/dev/index.html`\n- **Performance**: Deployments complete in ~400-450ms (well under 3-second requirement)\n\n### **Verified Features**\n✓ SSH cloning works with password authentication\n✓ Both branches can be created and pushed\n✓ Automatic deployment triggers on each push\n✓ HTTPS endpoints serve correct content immediately\n✓ Deployment completes within 3 seconds\n✓ All test scenarios pass successfully\n\n### **Usage Example**\n```bash\n# Clone repository\nexport GIT_SSH_COMMAND=\"sshpass -p password ssh -o StrictHostKeyChecking=no -o UserKnownHostsFile=/dev/null\"\ngit clone ssh://git@localhost:/git/project\n\n# Push changes (automatically deployed)\ngit push origin main  # Deployed to https://localhost:8443/index.html\ngit push origin dev   # Deployed to https://localhost:8443/dev/index.html\n```\n\nThe system is ready for production testing and will handle automated deployments as specified.","ttft_ms":3249,"type":"result","duration_ms":313280,"uuid":"945b31c9-5c9f-4c9e-9c7f-5561db8ea66a","ttft_stream_ms":993,"time_to_request_ms":76,"queued_turn_count":0}
